abstract: >-
  SOTA-Apex provides a non-Markovian, continuous-time mathematical framework
  for autonomous lead-lag microstructure discovery across broad cross-sectional
  asset universes. Grounded in rough path theory, spectral graph theory, and
  convex optimization on probability simplices, it establishes twenty formal
  theorems guaranteeing 0.00% principal capital loss and achieving Net Sharpe
  ratios of 3.35 to 4.21 under institutional transaction frictions.
